<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes" ?>
<!DOCTYPE helpcontent[
  <!ELEMENT helpcontent (helptopic+)>
  <!ELEMENT helptopic (title, item+)>
  <!ATTLIST helptopic id CDATA #REQUIRED>
  <!ELEMENT title (#PCDATA)>
  <!ELEMENT item (p+)>
  <!ELEMENT p (#PCDATA | b | i | u)*>
  <!ATTLIST p style (normal|bullet|important) #IMPLIED
              level (zero|one|two|three|four) #IMPLIED>
  <!ELEMENT b (#PCDATA)>
  <!ELEMENT i (#PCDATA)>
  <!ELEMENT u (#PCDATA)>
]>

<helpcontent>

<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_SHOWROOM_FREE_TRIAL">
<title>Download free trials</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To download a free trial game, select <b>Showroom</b>, a game, and <b>Options</b> > <b>Download Free Trial</b>.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To download games on your compatible PC, visit www.n-gage.com. You can transfer the games from the PC to your device with a USB cable.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b>, and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_SR_GAME_EXTRA_ABOUT">
<title>Details of game extras</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Showroom</b>, an extra, and <b>Options</b> > <b>View Details</b>.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Game extras are new or additional items, such as new characters, weapons, and levels, which may become available after the release of a game.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Download Game Extra</b>
- 
Download the selected game extra to your device.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_SR_GAME_EXTRA_LIST">
<title>Game extras</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Game extras are new or additional items, such as new characters, weapons, and levels, which may become available after the release of a game.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Showroom</b> > <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>View Details</b>
- 
View the details of the selected game extra.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Download Game Extra</b>
- 
Download the selected game extra to your device.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_SR_GAME_EXTRA_MEDIA">
<title>Preview game extras</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Showroom</b> and a game extra. Game extras are new or additional items, such as new characters, weapons, and levels, which may become available after the release of a game. You can view screenshots and video clips about a game extra, if available.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>View</b>
- 
View the screenshot or video clip in full screen.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Download Game Extra</b>
- 
Download the selected game extra to your device.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_SR_MAIN_FEATUREDGAME">
<title>Featured games</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To try a new game, select <b>Showroom</b>, and download a free trial. To purchase the game, select <b>Purchase</b> in the trial version.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>View Details</b>
- 
View the details of the selected game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Download Free Trial</b>
- 
Start downloading a free trial of the game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Update Now</b>
- 
Update the list of games.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_FRIENDS_FIND_FRIEND">
<title>Find players</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To search for N-Gage players, select <b>My Friends</b>, enter the name of the player in the search field, and select <b>Options</b> > <b>Submit</b>.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Sort Friends By</b>
- 
Arrange the players on your friends list by availability, player name, or N-Gage points.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_SR_MAIN_GAMESLIST">
<title>Find more games</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To see which games are available for downloading, select <b>Showroom</b> > <b>Options</b> > <b>Available Games</b>. New games are added to the showroom regularly.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Update Now</b>
- 
Update the list of available games.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_FRIENDS_MAIN_FRIEND">
<title>Friends</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To see which of your friends are online and available to play, select <b>My Friends</b>. You can also send and receive private messages and game recommendations, or search for particular N-Gage players and invite them to your friends list.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>View Message</b>
- 
View the private messages from the selected friend.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Send Message</b>
- 
Send a private message to the selected friend.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>View Recommendation</b>
- 
View the game recommendations from the selected friend.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Rate Player</b>
- 
Give a star rating to the selected friend.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Sort Friends By</b>
- 
Arrange your friends by availability, player name, or N-Gage points.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Remove from Friends List</b>
- 
Remove the selected friend from your friends list.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_SHOWROOM_GAME_DETAILS">
<title>Game details</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To read information about the game, download a free trial, and read reviews from other players, select <b>Showroom</b>.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Download Free Trial</b>
- 
Download a free trial game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
