<title>Game extras</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Game extras are new or additional items, such as new characters, weapons, and levels, which may become available after the release of a game.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Showroom</b> > <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Browse all Game Extras</b>
- 
View the game extras categories.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Update Now</b>
- 
Update the list of games.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_PROFILE_GAME">
<title>Game profile</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>My Profile</b> > <b>Options</b>, and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>View Details</b>
- 
View your N-Gage points, point pick-ups, and ranking for this game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Edit Profile</b>
- 
Edit your public player profile.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_SHOWROOM_GAME_MEDIA">
<title>Preview games</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To view screenshots and video clips of games, select <b>Showroom</b>.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>View</b>
- 
View the selected video clip or screenshot in full screen.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Download Free Trial</b>
- 
Download a free trial of the game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
