<title>Available games</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To try a new game, select <b>Showroom</b>, and download a free trial.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
 To purchase the game, select <b>Purchase</b> in the trial version.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>View Details</b>
- 
View the details of the selected game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Download Free Trial</b>
- 
Start downloading a free trial of the game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_GAMES_MAIN_GET_GAME">
<title>Get more games</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Showroom</b> > <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Go to Showroom</b>
- 
Check which games are available in the showroom.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_GAMES_MAIN_INSTALLED">
<title>Installed games</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To play and manage the games you have downloaded to your device, select <b>My Games</b>. The bar next to the selected game indicates your progress in the game.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Start Game</b>
- 
Start playing the selected game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Rate Game</b>
- 
Rate the selected game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>View My Profile</b>
- 
View your N-Gage points for the selected game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Send Recommendation</b>
- 
Recommend the game to a friend.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Remove Game</b>
- 
Remove the game from the device memory, but keep the game saves and other game data on the device.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Delete Game</b>
- 
Delete the game and all the associated game data from the device memory.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>View Memory Details</b>
- 
View the details on used and available memory.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_PROFILE_GEN_SETTINGS">
<title>Player level</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To check your N-Gage point level, select <b>My Profile</b>. The level is automatically calculated based on your N-Gage points.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To update your level, connect to the N-Gage service.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Edit Profile</b>
- 
Edit your public player profile.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="HOME_MESSAGES">
<title>Messages</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To read the messages received from your N-Gage friends, select <b>New Messages</b>.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>View Message</b>
- 
View the selected message or invitation.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Check for updates</b>
- 
Check for available updates.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
