- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_SR_MAIN_OPERAT_PORTAL">
<title>Operator portal</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To open your operator's portal in the Web browser and find more games, select <b>Showroom</b> > <b>Options</b> > <b>More Games at %U</b>.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
