<helptopic id="HOME_GAME">
<title>Play with your friends</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To connect with an N-Gage friend who is currently available to play, select <b>Play With Friends</b>.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>View My Friends</b>
- 
View your friends list.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Check for updates</b>
- 
Check for available updates.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_SHOWROOM_GAME_REVIEWS">
<title>Player reviews</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To read what other N-Gage players are saying about a game, select <b>Showroom</b> > <b>View Details</b> > <b>Reviews</b>.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Download Free Trial</b>
- 
Download a free trial of the game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_PROFILE_MAIN_OWN">
<title>Your player profile</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To set your availability, edit your public player profile, and modify your private account, select <b>My Profile</b>.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Your profile contains the following fields:</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
<b>N-Gage Points</b> shows the points you have earned by completing point pick-ups in games, playing multiplayer matches, and participating in the N-Gage community activities.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
<b>Rep</b> shows your gaming reputation as rated by your friends.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
<b>Friends</b> indicates how many friends you have.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
<b>N-Gage Point Level</b> indicates your level, based on your total N-Gage points. To update your N-Gage point level, connect to the N-Gage service.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
<b>Gaming History</b> lists your five most recently played games.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Profile details</b>
- 
View your N-Gage points.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Edit Profile</b>
- 
Edit your public player profile.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
After you have updated your profile, connect to the N-Gage service to synchronise the changes you made with the N-Gage server.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="HOME_SHOWROOM">
<title>Showroom</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To view the available games and download free trial games, select <b>Showroom</b>.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Featured Game</b>
- 
View the details of the selected game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Check for updates</b>
- 
Check for available updates.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="HOME_START_GAME">
<title>Start a game</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To start playing or resume the game you played last, or connect with an N-Gage friend who is available to play, select <b>Start Game</b>.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Start Game</b>
- 
Start playing the last-played game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Resume Game</b>
- 
Resume a paused game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Check for updates</b>
- 
Check for available updates.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="HOME_PROFILE">
<title>Track your points</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
To view your current N-Gage points, select <b>Track My Progress</b>.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>View My Points</b>
- 
Check your N-Gage points.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>View My Profile</b>
- 
View your player profile.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Check for updates</b>
- 
Check for available updates.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
<helptopic id="PLAY_HLP_GAME_MAIN_UNAVAILABLE">
<title>Unavailable games</title><item>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Open the N-Gage application.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>My Games</b>. Unavailable games are full games that you have uninstalled or downloaded, but the installation was not completed. Games installed to the memory card are also shown as unavailable when the memory card is removed. Unavailable games are not currently available for play.</p>

<p style="normal" level="zero">
Select <b>Options</b> and from the following:</p>

</item><item>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Cancel Download</b>
- 
Cancel the download of the selected game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Install Game</b>
- 
Install the selected game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Reinstall Game</b>
- 
Reinstall the selected game.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Delete Game</b>
- 
Delete the game and all the associated game data.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>View Memory Details</b>
- 
View the details on used and available memory.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>Set Online Status</b>
- 
Set your availability to play.
</p>
<p style="bullet" level="one"> 
<b>N-Gage Settings</b>
- 
Edit your private account.
</p>
</item><item>
<p style="normal" level="zero">
For more information, see www.n-gage.com.</p>

<p></p></item></helptopic>
</helpcontent>
